<title>UK: WestLB sets 1.0 billion mark seven-year pfandbrief.</title>
<headline>WestLB sets 1.0 billion mark seven-year pfandbrief.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>- The following Pfandbrief bond was announced by joint lead managers Westdeutsche Landesbank, Norddeutsche Landesbank, Bankgesellschaft Berlin and Landesbank Hessen-Thuringen Girozentale.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WESTDEUTSCHE LANDESBANK GZ</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN DEM   COUPON     4.75	MATURITY    12.DEC.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  96.29     PAY DATE    12.DEC.96</p>
<p> LISTING    DUSS	DENOMS (K) ONE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
